senses.gloss:
--the silver vessel used by पितृस् in milking the cow-earth;
1: M. १०. १८.
out of शिव's eye;
2: Ib. १५. ३१; १७. २०. २३.
best for use in श्राद्ध.
3: वा. ७३. ५१; ७४. 1.

(also राजपथस्)--royal roads as fre- quented by पिशाचस्;
1: Br. III. 7. ४०४; २७. ११.
in the city of श्रीपुरम्;
2: M. १३०. 3.
in the city of मथुरा;
3: Vi. V. १९. १२.
lighted by lamps during nights;
4: M. १३९. १९.
persons commit- ting nuisance in public roads were visited by fines and required to clean them.
5: Ib. २२७. १७५.

--a वीरमाता; a sister of Vasudeva; a daughter of शूर and Bhoja and queen of Jayasena, king of अवन्ती;
1: भा. IX. २४. ३१ and ३९; Br. III. ७१. १५१; M. ४६. 4; Vi. IV. १४. ३१.
paternal aunt of कृष्ण and queen of अवन्ती. Her daughter मित्रविन्दा loved by कृष्ण who took her away by force and married her, as her brothers wanted to bestow [page३-069+ ३२] her on Duryodhana;
2: भा. X. ५८. ३१.
according to the भागवत had two sons Vinda and Anuvinda;
3: वा. ९६. १४९.
mother of two sons.
4: Vi. IV. १४. ४३.
